{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12395","headline":"太子李舍人城东别业与二三文友逃暑 · 钱起","name":"太子李舍人城东别业与二三文友逃暑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下马失炎暑，重门深绿篁。\n宫臣礼嘉客，林表开兰堂。\n兹夕兴难尽，澄罍照墨塲。\n鲜风吹印绶，密坐皆馨香。\n美景惜文会，清吟迟羽觞。\n东林晚来好，目极趣何长。\n鸟道挂疎雨，人家残夕阳。\n城隅拥归骑，留醉恋琼芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}